	(text_box "Note: \nThe power bank case was chosen because of its form factor and have a complete charger solution built-in and finally its price.\n\nTaking advantage of those features acomplishes one of the product's features which is not to have cost with case customization.\n\nThen, some moding is required to use such case:\n- Li-ion battery replacement. A smaller Li-ion AA size fits;\n- Drill a hole for the knob."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
